ＴＯ協定、ガットと整合的であるなら、自…", "…載したらどうですか。それとも、何かやましいことでもあるんでしょうか。日米貿易協定が外務省のホームページのＥＰＡ、ＦＴＡのページに掲載されてい…"]}]}]}, {"date": "2020-12-03", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "参議院 外交防衛委員会", "remarks": [{"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/4", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/6", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/8", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/10", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/12", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/14", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/16", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/18", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/20", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/22", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/24", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/26", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/28", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/30", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/32", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/34", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/36", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/38", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/40", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/42", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120313950X00620201203/44", "sentence": ["…勲君非常に前向きな答弁、ありがとうございます。そういう中で、ちょっと日米貿易協定のＷＴＯへの通報についても、これ本会議で私聞いたんですけれど…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai